  "notes": "{砕|くだ}ける is an intransitive verb ({自動詞|じどうし}).\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Intransitive ({自動詞|じどうし})\n- Pair: {砕|くだ}く (transitive - to smash, crush)\n- Pattern: Xが{砕|くだ}ける\n\nASPECT ({ている}):\n{砕|くだ}けている describes a result state (something is broken) or an ongoing casual atmosphere.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {波|なみ}が{砕|くだ}ける (waves break)\n- {氷|こおり}が{砕|くだ}ける (ice shatters)\n- {砕|くだ}けた{雰囲気|ふんいき} (casual atmosphere)\n- {砕|くだ}けた{表現|ひょうげん} (casual expression)\n\nThe figurative sense 2 is common in describing casual speech or relaxed social situations.",
